00:57:20.040 --> 00:57:39.310
<v Ira Glass>Our website, thisamericanlife.org. This American Life is delivered to public radio stations by PRX, the Public Radio Exchange. Thanks, as always, to our program's co-founder, Mr. Torey Malatia. You know, I asked him, why is he so beloved? Is it because he's so great at his job? Or is he just so good-looking.

00:57:39.310 --> 00:57:41.960
<v Stacy Galbraith>Crap. It could be either one, really.

00:57:41.960 --> 00:57:46.710
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life .

00:57:46.710 --> 00:57:51.710
